body:
This has been updated to censor events for scripts with muted errors in the latest commit. Additionally, TC39 gave approval to merge https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/76, so as soon as Brian gets around to that (I'd guess Monday) that dependency will be taken care of.

As such I think this is ready for a final review. If I can get some LGTMs then I'll squash and merge this once the ecma262 PR is merged.

@zcorpan has some outstanding feedback at https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/224/files#r43070230 which we still need to agree on.
